<title>NORWAY: Elkem 1996 operating profits by division.</title>
<headline>Elkem 1996 operating profits by division.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Operating profits per division at Norwegian metals producer Elkem ASA for the 12 months to December 31.</p>
<p>				  (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Ferrosilicon		     349	 vs	  219</p>
<p> Manganese/chromium	     224	 vs	  334</p>
<p> Materials			  374	 vs	  164</p>
<p> Aluminium			  116	 vs	  295</p>
<p> Others		     minus  39	 vs	  123</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
